<div id="imageGallery4c07d268683d0ba790ba6223820fbb62" class="fade-gallery" style="width: 100%; height: auto; position: relative; padding: 0;"><img src="/images/2000/580/hp-gal-1?h=94cd3529" style="width: 100%;" data-url="" alt="Building repairs Wellington"><img src="/images/2000/580/hp-gal-img-new-2?h=d314e2dc" style="width: 100%;" data-url="" alt="Construction company Lower Hutt"><img src="/images/2000/580/hp-gal-img-new-3?h=65ca8cd3" style="width: 100%;" data-url="" alt="House builder Lower Hutt"></div><script>tasks.push(function() { $('#imageGallery4c07d268683d0ba790ba6223820fbb62').cycle({"timeout":4000,"speed":1000,"rotateDelay":0,"arrows":[],"arrowImages":{},"displayCaptions":false}); });</script></div></div><div id="sector579e1928c670ac4283823308" class="sector sectorMobile-gallery-section"><a class="anchor" id="Section579e19295f7f7b1efe60d2af"></a><div class="section SectionImageGallery" id="sectionBox579e19295f7f7b1efe60d2af">
<div id="imageGalleryb0718422f6dd8de35f6d24ba4d745791" class="fade-gallery" style="width: 100%; height: auto; position: relative; padding: 0;"><img src="/images/800/484/mob-gal-img-1?h=28c73616" style="width: 100%;" data-url="" alt="Home renovations Wellington"><img src="/images/800/484/mob-gal-img-2?h=feaf43b6" style="width: 100%;" data-url="" alt="House building companies Wellington"><img src="/images/800/484/mob-gal-img-3?h=8d7d5264" style="width: 100%;" data-url="" alt="House renovating Lower Hutt"></div><script>tasks.push(function() { $('#imageGalleryb0718422f6dd8de35f6d24ba4d745791').cycle({"timeout":4000,"speed":1000,"rotateDelay":0,"arrows":[],"arrowImages":{},"displayCaptions":false}); });</script></div></div></div><div id="sector579e192844b28c54cb64d27a" class="sector sectorgbl-mcp-wrapper"><div id="sector579e192806c5f4b7c56f8972" class="sector sectordsk-mcp-content"><a class="anchor" id="Section579e19290cb6f0b90fc5fd47"></a><div class="section SectionContent" id="sectionBox579e19290cb6f0b90fc5fd47">
<div style="border-width:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding:20px 0px 20px 0px;border-style:solid;border-color:transparent;background-color:transparent;" class="sectionBoxPlain"><h3 class="tb style57a0cc282fa7b23ff5e864a6"><center><b>Fendalton Construction provides comprehensive building services throughout the Wellington region.</b></center></h3><span class="tb style57a0cc286314865f25fbab61"><div><br></div><a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/"> Fendalton Construction</a> undertakes all aspects of the building process, including <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower">home renovations</a>, <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower">extensions</a>, additions,&nbsp;new homes, bathroom and <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower">kitchen renovations</a> and detailed joinery, carpentry, general building work, <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/leaky-homes-wellington">leaky home repairs</a>, seismic strengthening&nbsp;and strata maintenance. Our team of Wellington based, specialist trained builders, tradesmen and <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/licensed-building-practitioner">licensed building practitioners</a> incorporates a wide range of services by providing clients with the convenience of finding all building and relevant trade requirements in one place.<a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-building-companies"> Contact our friendly team</a> to discuss your ideas today.<br><br></span></div></div></div></div><div id="sector579e1928b6a979168e3c9366" class="sector sectorSCP-wrapper"><div id="sector579e1928d53aa7f8b9fde89b" class="sector sectorSCP-content"><a class="anchor" id="Section579e1929e2c20d3a1726bf26"></a><div class="section SectionColumn" id="sectionBox579e1929e2c20d3a1726bf26" style="clear: both;">
<div class="column-section-cell" data-id="579e19295f20981fc4753ccd"><a class="anchor" id="Section579e19295f20981fc4753ccd"></a><div class="section SectionContent" id="sectionBox579e19295f20981fc4753ccd">
<a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower"><img class="im_57e29bee770e6b57c433148f" data-hover="/images/385/341/scp-img-1-new-roll?h=9c8d4d7d" src="/images/385/341/scp-img-1-new?h=43c8dba9" style="border:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:50px;padding-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;display:block;width:100%;max-width:385px;" alt="Licensed building practitioner Wellington"></a><br><br><h3 class="tb style57a0d176b8725f8d3280027b"><b>BUILDING</b><br><br></h3><span class="tb style57a0cc2881c34c290a47e752">The professional licensed building practitioners at Fendalton Construction offer complete <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower">building services throughout the Wellington region</a>. Every possible type of building work is available, from bathroom&nbsp;and <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower">kitchen renovations</a> to full new builds and reconstructions.<br><br></span><a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/house-renovating-lower"><img class="im_57a0c394f8c4b2782197c543" data-hover="/images/119/40/scp-readmore-btn-hov?h=0909c627" src="/images/119/40/scp-readmore-btn?h=4f709cfe" style="border:0;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;display:block;width:100%;max-width:119px;" alt="Bathroom design Lower Hutt"></a><br></div></div><div class="column-section-cell" data-id="579e192937996cb0148e0a8c"><a class="anchor" id="Section579e192937996cb0148e0a8c"></a><div class="section SectionContent" id="sectionBox579e192937996cb0148e0a8c">
<a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/leaky-homes-wellington"><img class="im_57e29b92ec04e4ab4f7f6df1" data-hover="/images/385/341/scp-img-2-new-roll?h=7673b08a" src="/images/385/341/scp-img-2-new?h=e6d970fe" style="border:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:50px;padding-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;display:block;width:100%;max-width:385px;" alt="Building contractor Wellington"></a><br><br><h3 class="tb style57a0d176b8725f8d3280027b"><b>RECLADDING FOR LEAKY HOMES</b><br><br></h3><span class="tb style57a0cc2881c34c290a47e752">If you suspect you have a <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/leaky-homes-wellington">leaky home</a>&nbsp;contact <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/licensed-building-practitioner">Fendalton Construction</a> immediately. The experienced team can diagnose your problem and recommend <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/leaky-homes-wellington">leaky home repairs</a> to make your house safe and livable again. All repairs are possible from small plaster fixes to full recladding.<br><br></span><a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/leaky-homes-wellington"><img class="im_57a0c394f8c4b2782197c543" data-hover="/images/119/40/scp-readmore-btn-hov?h=0909c627" src="/images/119/40/scp-readmore-btn?h=4f709cfe" style="border:0;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;display:block;width:100%;max-width:119px;" alt="services Hutt renovations"></a><br></div></div><div class="column-section-cell" data-id="579e1929bd103cc36cd225e8"><a class="anchor" id="Section579e1929bd103cc36cd225e8"></a><div class="section SectionContent" id="sectionBox579e1929bd103cc36cd225e8">
<a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/land-development-wellington"><img class="im_57e29b25d53b6af4437ecd4f" data-hover="/images/385/341/scp-img-3-new-roll?h=e9b2e4d7" src="/images/385/341/scp-img-3-new?h=18396a1d" style="border:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:50px;padding-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;display:block;width:100%;max-width:385px;" alt="Lower Home wide,"></a><br><br><h3 class="tb style57a0d176b8725f8d3280027b"><b>LAND DEVELOPMENT</b><br><br></h3><span class="tb style57a0cc2881c34c290a47e752">Solutions for <a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/land-development-wellington">land development projects in the Wellington region</a> are possible when you employ the expert services of&nbsp;<a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/licensed-building-practitioner">Fendalton Construction</a>. A complete land development project management package means you don't have to worry about compliance paperwork or construction matters.<br><br></span><a href="https://www.fendaltonconstruction.co.nz/land-development-wellington"><img class="im_57a0c394f8c4b2782197c543" data-hover="/images/119/40/scp-readmore-btn-hov?h=0909c627" src="/images/119/40/scp-readmore-btn?h=4f709cfe" style="border:0;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;display:block;width:100%;max-width:119px;" alt="Hutt building services"></a><br></div></div><style>@media (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 740px) { .column-section-cell[data-id="579e19295f20981fc4753ccd"] {width:100%;}}@media (min-width: 741px) and (max-width: 1024px) { .column-section-cell[data-id="579e19295f20981fc4753ccd"] {width:100%;}}@media (min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 10000px) { .column-section-cell[data-id="579e19295f20981fc4753ccd"] {width:33%;padding-right:20px;}}@media (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 740px) { .column-section-cell[data-id="579e192937996cb0148e0a8c"] {width:100%;}}@media (min-width: 741px) and (max-width: 1024px) { .column-section-cell[data-id="579e192937996cb0148e0a8c"] {width:100%;}}@